## Destination Certificate assigned to Service Instances on Cloud Foundry Extension Landscapes

In case you want to read destination certificate assigned to service instances on a Cloud Foundry **extension landscape**, you must provide the attribute `extension_landscape`.

You can retrieve the value of the extension landscape e.g., via the attribute `landscape_label` of the resource `btp_subaccount_environment_instance` or via the same attribute of the data source `btp_subaccount_environment_instance`.
